{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"QUIZTON ( THESIS PROJECT )","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/bc3b9/quizton_banner.png","srcSet":"/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/9a130/quizton_banner.png 175w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/a3fa1/quizton_banner.png 350w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/bc3b9/quizton_banner.png 700w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/87926/quizton_banner.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/dae43/quizton_banner.avif 175w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/d7667/quizton_banner.avif 350w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/7ec1a/quizton_banner.avif 700w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/71a30/quizton_banner.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/5d873/quizton_banner.webp 175w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/26a00/quizton_banner.webp 350w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/f23f0/quizton_banner.webp 700w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/2c2d0/quizton_banner.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["Python","HTML","CSS","Javascript","Firebase","Cloudinary","Render","Spacy"],"github":"https://github.com/paufrancisco/QUIZTON","external":"https://github.com/paufrancisco/QUIZTON","tag":null},"html":"<p><strong>QUIZTON</strong> is an AI-powered web app that helps educators of <a href=\"https://sjcdc.phinma.edu.ph/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">St. Jude College Dasmariñas</a> save time and effort by automatically transforming PDF lecture materials into customized quizzes. It solves the problem of manual quiz preparation through intelligent PDF conversion, a centralized question bank, and flexible export options — streamlining assessment and enhancing teaching efficiency.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Integrated Mosquito Detection and Fumigation System Utilizing Faster RCNN","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/86361/scale_website.jpg","srcSet":"/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/3f1b3/scale_website.jpg 175w,\n/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/3961c/scale_website.jpg 350w,\n/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/86361/scale_website.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/bf026/scale_website.avif 175w,\n/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/53a94/scale_website.avif 350w,\n/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/3f7ae/scale_website.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/48048/scale_website.webp 175w,\n/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/d8098/scale_website.webp 350w,\n/static/f9ee1c977184b5643742c4f9335e1a52/c73ff/scale_website.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":500.00000000000006}}},"tech":["TensorFlow","Detectron2","Arduino","GCP","Django"],"github":"https://github.com/PeteCastle/MosquitoDetectionFumigation","external":"https://github.com/PeteCastle/MosquitoDetectionFumigation","tag":"Upcoming"},"html":"<p>Integrates computer science, machine learning, Arduino development, and entomology to address mosquito-related challenges in the Philippines. <a href=\"https://medium.com/@soumyajitdatta123/faster-rcnns-explained-af76f96a0b70\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Faster Region-Based Convolutional Neural Network</a> model for real-time mosquito detection is developed, with a web-based interface for data visualization and an automated fumigation system triggered by detection.</p>\n<p><em>Note that the repository is currently private due to security issues.</em></p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Global Conflict Analysis","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/10252/conflict-analysis.png","srcSet":"/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/68202/conflict-analysis.png 175w,\n/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/fe25d/conflict-analysis.png 350w,\n/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/10252/conflict-analysis.png 700w,\n/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/38baa/conflict-analysis.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/1934d/conflict-analysis.avif 175w,\n/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/8f8aa/conflict-analysis.avif 350w,\n/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/62eae/conflict-analysis.avif 700w,\n/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/59191/conflict-analysis.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/745fa/conflict-analysis.webp 175w,\n/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/b0f73/conflict-analysis.webp 350w,\n/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/ea0a8/conflict-analysis.webp 700w,\n/static/9d973c6a60ebb77179d04e85c945f4b2/4bd52/conflict-analysis.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"tech":["PowerQuery","PowerBI","Pandas"],"github":"https://github.com/PeteCastle/World-Conflict-Analysis","external":"https://github.com/PeteCastle/World-Conflict-Analysis","tag":null},"html":"<p>The <a href=\"https://ucdp.uu.se/downloads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">UCDP Georeferenced Event Dataset (GED)</a> Global provides a comprehensive repository of data on global conflict events, yet struggles to gain visibility in mainstream media. This lack of awareness hinders public understanding of the scale and impact of conflicts worldwide.</p>\n<p>Bridging the gap between the dataset and media through effective visualizations and targeted dissemination is crucial for fostering empathy, informed decision-making, and engagement in conflict resolution efforts.</p>"}}]}}}